  nerrationText:
  - 'Commander: War room, what''s going in Mumbai? '
  - 'War Room: You heard it right. The sleeper cells of terrorist groups have taken
    control of Mumbai. '
  - 'Commander: How did they all slip through? '
  - 'War Room: They did not. They were here all along. We failed to spot them. '
  - 'Commander: Enemy knew the armed forces were deployed elsewhere, so they popped
    up at the gateway. Do we have anyone to take care of these bastards?'
  - 'War room: We had only one squad. They were ambushed. Only one commando is in
    fighting condition. '
  - "Commander: Only one? That's bad. What\u2019s his call sign? "
  - 'War Room: Call sign Kobra. '
  - 'Commander: Then one should be enough to wipe out all. '
